The bundled command-line tools include an Emscripten build of libheif and
libde265 (via the `libheif-js` package) to read HEIC/HEIF photographs. Those
libraries are licensed under LGPL-3.0; their unmodified sources are available at:

- https://github.com/strukturag/libheif
- https://github.com/strukturag/libde265

The wasm module is packaged as part of `resources/cli-tools/dist/img-tool.mjs`
and can be replaced by rebuilding that bundle from the sources above.

